        "date": "2026-11-16T07:01:13Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(wcs): carry Z-rotated work offset through generation and post\n\nGenerate upright 3-axis milling operations in the Z-rotated WCS frame\n(W_gen) and rotate generated toolpaths, regions, and located errors back\ninto setup table coordinates (S). Add WcsRotationOutput (Bake default,\nopt-in Control G68/ROT for Fanuc/Haas/Mazak/Doosan DNM/Sinumerik when\nboth .mch and .cps declare support), stamp wcs-yaw staleness, keep\nmachine travel limits in S, and guard 3-2-1 mill face alignment against\ntilted faces.\n\nFixes #760",
      "tree": {
